  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n((3)/(4)-frac1{3}div(1)/(3) of (9)/(5))div((7)/(16)div(1)/(2) of (1)/(5)) of (4)/(15)-(2)/(3)\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4cc8f63640c17e5af9cdfc3b1e0aec219549b666eec21d379b8feb7bd6c52eb4.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n((3)/(4)-frac1{3}div(1)/(3) of (9)/(5))div((7)/(16)div(1)/(2) of (1)/(5)) of (4)/(15)-(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ ((3)/(4)-frac1{3}div (3)/(5))div((7)/(16)div(1)/(10)) of (4)/(15)-(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ ((3)/(4)-frac1{3}times (5)/(3))div((7)/(16)times{10}) of (4)/(15)-(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ ((3)/(4)-frac5{9})div(35)/(8) of (4)/(15)-(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ ((27 - 20)/(36))div(35)/(8) of (4)/(15)-(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ (7)/(36)div(35)/(8) of (4)/(15)-(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ (7)/(36)div(7)/(6)-(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ (7)/(36)times(6)/(7)-(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ (1)/(6)-(2)/(3)\n\n⇒ (1 - 4)/(6) = (- 3)/(6) = (- 1)/(2)\n\n**∴ The required answer is (- 1)/(2).**",
